# Keeps the build context small for every Dockerfile in this repo (all use `context: .`, the
# repo root - see docker-compose.yml). Without this, `docker compose build` sends web's
# node_modules and every service's Maven target/ across the daemon socket on every build, even
# though no Dockerfile COPYs them wholesale - each one rebuilds fresh (`npm ci` / `mvn package`)
# inside the image instead.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
.git
